    "Name": "Arachnid Prime",
    "Details": "The two massive railguns defines the Arachnid's primary configuration, both in appearance and in design. Even with the railguns taking up almost two thirds of the available internal space and weight capacity in the giant QuadMech, two ER PPC and an ER Large laser are mounted in the center torso to provide even more firepower. Using 33.5 tons of the latest Titano-Carbide Lamellor armor still allows more than enough armor to survive even the strongest attacks with just minor damages.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Intimidating</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.45</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_arachnid"
  },
